Hello Dealers!

As promised, we’re coming to you today with new crashfixes and a batch of additional changes! The main course is the travel crash fix, which you helped us identify and confirm the solution. 

From the data you sent we know that this problem was responsible for as much as [b]79%[/b] of crashes. Fixing it should make a [u]BIG[/u] difference for stability overall. ([i]Other crash reasons will be dealt with too in future updates.[/i])
[b]
Let’s dive straight into Update Notes:[/b]

[*] Fixed crash related to NPCs navigation, most frequently observed when travelling, especially via vehicles;
[*]Fixed an issue where the player could be bitten by a snake while quick-travelling;
[*]Fixed an issue that could cause the game to save automatically during quick travel;
[*]Fixed an issue where the player could not move after quick travel;
[*]Added new VO for thugs, policemen and militia;
[*]Added VO for bodyguards;
[*]The trade dialogue option is now the first choice with shopkeepers.

Thank you all for reporting your crashes and testing out the solutions. Your help was invaluable!

Stay tuned, more updates are coming soon!

